@startuml
title Proposed multi-repository delivery coordination
rectangle "Milestone manifest" as Manifest
rectangle "Unit A: contracts repository\nOwn PR, SHA, policy, CI and reviews" as A
rectangle "Unit B: service repository\nOwn PR, SHA, policy, CI and reviews" as B
rectangle "Dependency availability check\nPR exists does not imply available changes" as Dependency
rectangle "Existing repository resource leases" as Leases
rectangle "Aggregate readiness and evidence report" as Report
Manifest --> A : independent preparation
Manifest --> B : independent preparation
A --> Dependency : observed dependency state
Dependency --> B : block until required content available
Leases --> A : repository A write exclusion
Leases --> B : repository B write exclusion
A --> Report : observed state and blockers
B --> Report : observed state and blockers
note bottom of Report
No cross-repository atomic transaction.
No merge or deployment action.
end note
@enduml
